MURDOCK 1962

The format of the data in these files is serial position as a function
of output position. Each row of data corresponds to one
subject=trial. For example, if the data were: 

20 19 18 15 1 5 8 

that means that the subject recalled item 20, then item
19, etc.  

The code 88 means that the subject made an extra-list
intrusion

 
